{
  "about": "Forms that ask instead of telling. The store's order numbers are small `get` forms: the answer is ops that fill a sheet and open it. A search form's answer is a screen, which takes the form's own screen's place and keeps what was typed.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "note": "The app starts and asks for its shell.",
      "send": {"t":"start"},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":1,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/_navree/native/shell","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "The shell arrives: its destinations, and the first one's first screen is asked for.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":1,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "store/shell.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"app"},
          {"t":"nav"},
          {"t":"screen","id":1}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":2,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "The first page.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":2,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "store/dashboard.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":1}
        ],
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"select","destination":1},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"nav"},
          {"t":"screen","id":2}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":3,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/orders","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"response","request":3,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "store/orders.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":2}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"stream_open","stream":1,"url":"https://shop.example/broadcasting/stream?topics=orders,activity,stats,inventory","headers":[["accept","text/event-stream"],["x-navree-native","1"]]}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "The person taps an order's number: the button sends the form it stands in, which has no id of the server's and goes by its address. (The answer kept here is the one the store recorded for order 1.)",
      "send": {"t":"act","screen":2,"action":{"t":"submit"},"form":"@/orders/200000/peek"},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":2}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":4,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/orders/200000/peek","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":60000}
        ]
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/2/forms/@~1orders~1200000~1peek/pending","is":true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "note": "The answer morphs the sheet `order` and opens it. The sheet brought forms of its own, which now have state.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":4,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "store/order-peek.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":2}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":5,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/orders/1/steps","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":15000},
          {"t":"fetch","request":6,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/orders/1/others","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":15000}
        ]
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/2/overlays","is":["order"]},
        {"at":"/screens/2/forms/@~1orders~1200000~1peek/pending","is":false},
        {"at":"/screens/2/forms/refund/fields/refund-amount/value/text","is":"7,848.00"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "note": "The sheet came with two regions that fetch themselves once they are here. The first answers with a screen whose body becomes what the region holds.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":5,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "store/order-steps.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":2}
        ],
        "effects": []
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/2/regions/order-steps/loading","is":false},
        {"at":"/screens/2/regions/order-others/loading","is":true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"response","request":6,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "store/order-others.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":2}
        ],
        "effects": []
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/2/regions/order-others/loading","is":false}
      ]
    },
    {
      "note": "A button in the sheet closes the sheet it stands in.",
      "send": {"t":"act","screen":2,"action":{"t":"dismiss"},"overlay":"order"},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":2}
        ],
        "effects": []
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/2/overlays","is":[]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"act","screen":2,"action":{"t":"navigate","href":"/find"}},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"nav"},
          {"t":"screen","id":3}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":7,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/find","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000},
          {"t":"stream_close","stream":1}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"response","request":7,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "made/find.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":3}
        ],
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"field","screen":3,"form":"find","field":"find.q","value":{"t":"text","text":"shawl"}},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"form","screen":3,"form":"find"}
        ],
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"field","screen":3,"form":"find","field":"find.in_stock","value":{"t":"flag","on":true}},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"form","screen":3,"form":"find"}
        ],
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "A `get` form becomes a query on its address.",
      "send": {"t":"act","screen":3,"action":{"t":"submit"},"form":"find"},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":3}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":8,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/find?q=shawl&in_stock=on","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":60000}
        ]
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/3/loading","is":true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "note": "The answer is a screen: it takes this screen's place, at the address that was asked, and the form still holds what was typed.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":8,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "made/find-results.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":3}
        ],
        "effects": []
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/destinations/1/stack","is":[2,3]},
        {"at":"/screens/3/url","is":"/find?q=shawl&in_stock=on"},
        {"at":"/screens/3/forms/find/fields/find.q/value/text","is":"shawl"},
        {"at":"/screens/3/loading","is":false},
        {"at":"/screens/3/content/screen/body/children/1/id","is":"found"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"act","screen":3,"action":{"t":"navigate","href":"/catalogue"}},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"nav"},
          {"t":"screen","id":4}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":9,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/catalogue","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "A screen that has a search of its own.",
      "send": {"t":"response","request":9,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "made/catalogue.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":4}
        ],
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "The person searches. The words go under the search's name, with what else the search carries, as a query to its address; the screen stays and takes the answer.",
      "send": {"t":"search","screen":4,"text":"lota"},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":4}
        ],
        "effects": [
          {"t":"fetch","request":10,"method":"get","url":"https://shop.example/catalogue?sort=name&q=lota","headers":[["x-navree-native","1"],["x-navree-client","platform=android; form=phone; vocab=1; scheme=light; contrast=normal; text=1.00"],["accept","application/vnd.navree.native+json"]],"timeout_ms":30000}
        ]
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/4/url","is":"/catalogue?sort=name&q=lota"},
        {"at":"/screens/4/loading","is":true},
        {"at":"/destinations/1/stack","is":[2,3,4]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "send": {"t":"response","request":10,"status":200,"content_type":"application/vnd.navree.native+json"},
      "body": "made/catalogue-lota.json",
      "expect": {
        "changed": [
          {"t":"screen","id":4}
        ],
        "effects": []
      },
      "check": [
        {"at":"/screens/4/content/screen/body/children/1","is":null},
        {"at":"/screens/4/content/screen/search/value","is":"lota"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "note": "The same search again asks nothing.",
      "send": {"t":"search","screen":4,"text":"lota"},
      "expect": {
        "changed": [],
        "effects": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
